  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Procurement law and guidance",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The new regime applies to all regulated contracts whose procurement was commenced on or after 24 February 2025 . Generally, a procurement will be commenced on the date that the contract notice/advertisement is published.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Procurement Act 2023 is organised in a logical way, from key principles at the start, through pre-procurement, procurement processes and award, contract management, to remedies and oversight.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The guidance note outlines key considerations for purchasing clinical NHS healthcare services under the Health Care Services (Provider Selection Regime) Regulations 2023 effective from 1 January 2024.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A collection of FAQs on the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "5 in 25 Countdown series",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "5 in 25 Countdown series"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Our 5 in 25 series looks at the impact of the Act throughout the procurement process and the operation of a public contract, from pre-procurement considerations, through choice of procedure and advertisement/transparency, to selection, evaluation, award, challenges, and operating (and reporting on) the contract.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "5 in 25 Countdown series"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Latest news and useful resources",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Detailed briefing",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Detailed briefing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Our detailed briefing looks at the whole Act by chapter, noting key changes and departures from the Public Contracts Regulations 2015",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Detailed briefing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Phrasebook",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Phrasebook"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Our procurement phrasebook will guide you through the new terminology in the Act.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Phrasebook"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Light Touch Regime",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Light Touch Regime"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Our handy guide to how the new Act will apply to \"light touch\" services.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Light Touch Regime"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Transparency",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The requirement to publish a much greater range of transparency notices is one of the key changes under the Act. Our briefing lists out all the notices required under the Act and indicates whether or not these are mandatory.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Government Commercial College training resources on the Act Anyone working in or advising the public sector should be able to register with Government Commercial College. There is a 10-module training course on the Procurement Act 2023, including resources and leading to a certificate. There are also Communities of Practice, discussion forums and presentations on a wide range of relevant topics. Learn more",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Anyone working in or advising the public sector should be able to register with Government Commercial College.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "There is a 10-module training course on the Procurement Act 2023, including resources and leading to a certificate. There are also Communities of Practice, discussion forums and presentations on a wide range of relevant topics.",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Provider Selection Regime From 1 January 2024, the Provider Selection Regime comes into force for the procurement of NHS healthcare services; the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 will no longer apply in relation to these services from 1 January 2024. View our guidance note",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "From 1 January 2024, the Provider Selection Regime comes into force for the procurement of NHS healthcare services; the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 will no longer apply in relation to these services from 1 January 2024.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Short Guides The government has also published some \"Short Guides\" aimed at suppliers and senior leaders, together with a series of high level videos aimed at practitioners, authorities and suppliers. View our guides",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The government has also published some \"Short Guides\" aimed at suppliers and senior leaders, together with a series of high level videos aimed at practitioners, authorities and suppliers.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The government's Transforming Public Procurement page This page contains all the latest government updates in relation to the implementation of the Procurement Act 2023. View the paper",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
        "Transparency"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "This page contains all the latest government updates in relation to the implementation of the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
