      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Legislation.gov.uk - text of the Procurement Act 2023 You can view the text of the Procurement Act 2023 on this page. View the Procurement Act 2023",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement law and guidance",
        "Latest news and useful resources",
